<title>UK: Commerzbank sets warrants on the U.S. dollar.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank sets warrants on the U.S. dollar.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerzbank AG said it has issued 60 million American style call and put warrants, in six equal tranches, on the U.S dollar.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p>ONE WARRANT CONTROLS $100.0</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 06.MAR.97-02.MAR.98   PAYDATE	27.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FRANKFURT, DUSSELDORF</p>
<p>* * * * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRIKE	  ISSUE</p>
<p> CALL	 1.60 DEM	10.42 DEM</p>
<p> CALL	 1.70 DEM	 4.93 DEM</p>
<p> CALL	 1.75 DEM	 3.41 DEM</p>
<p> CALL	 1.80 DEM	 2.25 DEM</p>
<p> PUT	  1.65 DEM	 6.41 DEM</p>
<p> PUT	  1.70 DEM	 9.22 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
